        {
          "category": "可可粉",
          "quantity": 3,
          "unit": "g",
          "tag": ""
        }
      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "text": "软化混合：软化的马斯卡彭和奶酪芝士混合均匀。",
          "images": [
            "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sheep930/sheep930@main/images/1788477000287_r6v00m.jpg"
          ],
          "materials": [
            0,
            1
          ],
          "timerMinutes": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "蛋黄打发：将细砂糖和水烧开，倒入蛋中，快速搅拌到蛋黄乳化打发。",
          "images": [
            "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sheep930/sheep930@main/images/1788477002789_r9p7ri.jpg",
            "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sheep930/sheep930@main/images/1788477005317_ctun65.jpg",
            "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sheep930/sheep930@main/images/1788477007372_ncokd1.jpg"
          ],
          "materials": [
            3,
            4,
            2
          ],
          "timerMinutes": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "打发好的蛋黄，导入芝士内，混合均匀。",
          "images": [
            "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sheep930/sheep930@main/images/1788477010466_46ks7l.jpg",
            "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sheep930/sheep930@main/images/1788477012562_5ikzd8.jpg"
          ],
          "materials": [],
          "timerMinutes": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "奶油打发：淡奶油加入糖粉，搅拌到蛋糕抹面的程度。",
          "images": [
            "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sheep930/sheep930@main/images/1788477014634_opbupg.jpg",
            "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sheep930/sheep930@main/images/1788477016742_2biel0.jpg",
            "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sheep930/sheep930@main/images/1788477018743_i50odw.jpg"
          ],
          "materials": [
            6,
            5
          ],
          "timerMinutes": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "把打发的奶油加入之前的芝士糊内，轻轻的搅拌。",
          "images": [
            "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sheep930/sheep930@main/images/1788477020851_31pb6a.jpg",
            "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sheep930/sheep930@main/images/1788477023568_d3nqlf.jpg"
          ],
          "materials": [],
          "timerMinutes": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "组装蛋糕：把手指饼干蘸一下咖啡液，一层饼干，一层芝士，面上撒一层糖粉，然后再撒可可粉，可可粉可以等到吃的时候再撒。",
          "images": [
            "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sheep930/sheep930@main/images/1788477025628_6om937.jpg",
            "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sheep930/sheep930@main/images/1788477027562_nwjjjz.jpg",
            "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sheep930/sheep930@main/images/1788477029637_9flwja.jpg",
            "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sheep930/sheep930@main/images/1788477031981_q5aknc.jpg"
          ],
          "materials": [
            7
          ],
          "timerMinutes": 0
        }
