      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "text": "把材料放入放入厨师机，搅拌出厚膜。",
          "images": [
            "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sheep930/sheep930@main/images/1788446799869_l2l6f4.jpg",
            "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sheep930/sheep930@main/images/1788446803507_xqmt4z.jpg"
          ],
          "materials": [
            1,
            2,
            3,
            4,
            5,
            6,
            7,
            8,
            9
          ],
          "timerMinutes": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "加入软化的黄油，搅拌出手套膜。",
          "images": [
            "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sheep930/sheep930@main/images/1788446805544_fiycux.jpg",
            "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sheep930/sheep930@main/images/1788446807911_udda7q.jpg"
          ],
          "materials": [
            10
          ],
          "timerMinutes": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "揉好的面团，温度30度，发酵40-60分钟。",
          "images": [
            "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sheep930/sheep930@main/images/1788446809967_rgbasb.jpg"
          ],
          "materials": [],
          "timerMinutes": 40
        },
        {
          "text": "分成2份，分好之后揉圆松弛20分钟。",
          "images": [
            "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sheep930/sheep930@main/images/1788446812520_yq2qmd.jpg",
            "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sheep930/sheep930@main/images/1788446815300_nipb6i.jpg"
          ],
          "materials": [],
          "timerMinutes": 20
        },
        {
          "text": "做开心果奶酪夹心",
          "images": [
            "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sheep930/sheep930@main/images/1788446818256_g1w799.jpg"
          ],
          "materials": [
            12,
            13,
            14
          ],
          "timerMinutes": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "把松弛好的面团，擀的尽量长一点。",
          "images": [
            "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sheep930/sheep930@main/images/1788446821540_0l4r80.jpg"
          ],
          "materials": [],
          "timerMinutes": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "涂抹开心果夹心，越薄越好。",
          "images": [
            "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sheep930/sheep930@main/images/1788446824057_vhv161.jpg"
          ],
          "materials": [],
          "timerMinutes": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "卷的稍微紧一点，从中间隔开",
          "images": [
            "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sheep930/sheep930@main/images/1788446826866_ouj7oq.jpg",
            "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sheep930/sheep930@main/images/1788446829846_7zr2et.jpg"
          ],
          "materials": [],
          "timerMinutes": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "卷起来，放入低糖吐司盒，发酵大约一个小时到一个半小时，发酵至9分满。",
          "images": [
            "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sheep930/sheep930@main/images/1788446833421_4ptlu9.jpg",
            "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sheep930/sheep930@main/images/1788446836477_xyts35.jpg",
            "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sheep930/sheep930@main/images/1788446839655_wog1cp.jpg"
          ],
          "materials": [],
          "timerMinutes": 80
        },
        {
          "text": "预热烤箱，上温190，下温180，最下层，烤26分钟左右。",
          "images": [
            "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sheep930/sheep930@main/images/1788446842228_q6n143.jpg",
            "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sheep930/sheep930@main/images/1788446995473_dndvyr.jpg",
            "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sheep930/sheep930@main/images/1788446847552_hr7j8b.jpg"
